+# Plan: createPatch
+Single function in `src/index.ts` reusing `clone`, `jsonEqual`, `has`, `isObject`.
+- Objects: remove missing keys, recurse on common keys, add new keys.
+- Arrays: trim common prefix/suffix, LCS (by deep equality) on the middle; walk the gaps between matches left to right, pairing removed/added items positionally (recurse into pairs), leftovers become remove/add at the running index.
+- Type mismatch / differing scalars: `replace`. Pointer tokens escaped (`~`→`~0`, `/`→`~1`).
+- Tests in `test/create-patch.test.ts` (round trip via `applyPatch`, minimality, no mutation).
